@@ -21,6 +21,16 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Commands
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
+
+* `init` - creates an analysis configuration
+* `generateReports` - generates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape` - creates or updates a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/index.html`), aggregating the results of multiple analyses; the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands
+* `updateLandscape` - the older name of `analyzeLandscape`, same behavior and options
+* `updateConfig` - updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+
 ### Docker
 
